    "description": "You had us at Chicken and bacon, but then throw ranch into the mix - we’re sold! This video shares an easy recipe for Chicken Bacon Ranch Dip, the ultimate party dip for your next gathering. The recipe calls for melting cream cheese along with ranch dressing mix in the microwave, and then combining with chicken, sour cream, bacon, and a few other savory ingredients. Cook in the oven for about 35 minutes total, serve with chips or bread, and you’ll have an appetizer that’s sure to be a crowd pleaser at your next party. ",
